<title>SINGAPORE: Guthrie 1996 net profit rises 133 pct.</title>
<headline>Guthrie 1996 net profit rises 133 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1997</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			17.06  vs	7.32</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)	     2.50  vs	2.50</p>
<p>    Special dividend (percent)   5.00  vs     10.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		2.60  vs	1.11</p>
<p>    Turnover			 165.02  vs    171.86</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest  5.09  vs	2.39</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)	     2.80  vs	2.71</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortization    2.38  vs	1.96</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  25.81  vs     12.87</p>
<p>    Losses from associates	 0.91  vs	0.16</p>
<p>    Tax				  7.81  vs	5.37</p>
<p>    Minorities (losses)	    0.04  vs	0.01</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gains	   14.84  vs     28.46</p>
<p>Note - Guthrie GTS Ltd's core activities are in engineering, property investment and development, and strategic investments in synergistic businesses.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
